        <span class="font-futura font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl leading-tight">
          What is the bleep test?
        </span>

        <svg
          data-collapsible-target="chevron"
          class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"
          />
        </svg>

      </button>

      <div
        data-collapsible-target="section"
        class="hidden pt-4"
      >
        <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
          The Bleep Test is a progressive fitness challenge designed to measure aerobic endurance.
          Participants run back and forth between two markers, 20 metres apart,
          each marker must be reached before an audio bleep sounds.
        </p>

        <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
          As the levels increase, the time between bleeps becomes shorter,
          making the test gradually more challenging.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- FAQ ITEM -->
