        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            The Kettlebell Test
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants carry kettlebells between markers and perform
            kettlebell swings before the next level begins.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of mental focus and controlled movement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            Throw
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants run shuttle laps and throw a weighted ball
            over a set height positioned at the midpoint of the course.
            As the time between bleeps shorten, maintaining power, coordination,
            and consistency is key.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of endurance, explosive movement and control under pressure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            Biceps + Lunges
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants move via walking lunges while performing controlled bicep curls
            with each repetition.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of muscular endurance, balance, and movement quality.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            Slay the Sled
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants push a weighted sled between markers while keeping pace
            with the bleeps.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of lower-body power and aerobic endurance.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

